msgid "llm.output_language_rule"
msgstr "Write all athlete-facing prose in English. Translate explanatory labels, but preserve names, quoted athlete text, units, JSON keys, tool names, and training values exactly. If the prompt contains French examples or an older French-only instruction, this English output rule takes precedence."

