msgid "common.help"
msgstr ""
"<b>Banister — Help</b>\n\n"
"• /setup — Configure your profile and generate a plan\n"
"• /plan — View this week's training schedule\n"
"• /week N — View week N of your plan\n"
"• /fitness — View your fitness metrics (CTL/ATL/TSB)\n"
"• /summary — Weekly recap\n"
"• /review — Review a completed workout\n"
"• /goal — Change your goal and regenerate the plan\n"
"• /publish — Publish the next 2 weeks to your calendar\n"
"• /unpublish — Remove published workouts\n"
"• /reminders — Manage workout reminders\n"
"• /voice — Choose your coach's voice\n"
"• /reset — Delete your profile and local history (keeps intervals.icu data)\n"
"• /cancel — Stop an ongoing /setup, /goal, or /reset\n\n"
"You can also ask me questions freely! 💬\n"
"🍽️ Tell me what you eat, too — I'll log it and estimate the calories without a special command."

