msgstr "If you'd like, I can suggest a next ride based on what you're up for and how much time you have."
msgid "llm.coach_blocks.fallback_session_goal"
msgstr "Session logged and counted in your plan."
msgid "llm.coach_blocks.fallback_advice_goal"
